cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software itself and the paper below."
title: AlleleMiner
abstract: >-
  A long-read pipeline for gene-wise de novo allele phasing in diploid genomes.
  AlleleMiner reconstructs the two allele sequences of each target gene directly
  from PacBio HiFi reads, using the reference genome only to define the target
  locus and to recruit reads.
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-08-01"
license: MIT
